### AutoHub API - Auth, Password Recovery & Verification Demo Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Request Password Reset Link (Triggers Gorgeous HTML Email to Mailpit SMTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/password/email
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@rederevenda.com"
}

### 2. Reset Password (Requires Email, 6-digit Code from Mailpit, and Password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@rederevenda.com",
  "token": "123456",
  "password": "newsecret123",
  "password_confirmation": "newsecret123"
}

### 3. Send Email Verification (Triggers Gorgeous Validation HTML Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/send-verification
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "comprador@gmail.com"
}

### 4. Verify Email Address (Marks User's Email as Verified)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "comprador@gmail.com"
}
